# postiz-agent dispatch: autonomous daily publishing (Linux/macOS crontab)
#
# Runs once a day at 08:00 local time. dispatch exits 0 with "nothing pending"
# when there is no story to publish, so it is safe to run more often (e.g. hourly
# or every 30 min) if you want the agent to pick up fresh AudioKids output quickly.
#
# Install with:
#   crontab -e
#   (paste the line below, adjust the path to where you cloned postiz-agent)
#
# Build with pnpm build, create the product tenant, and verify one real post first.
# Replace the node path, repository path, tenant and platforms for your operator.
# Ensure data/ exists. stdout is JSONL; diagnostics go to a separate log.

0 8 * * * cd /path/to/postiz-agent && /usr/local/bin/node dist/cli.js dispatch --tenant product --platforms x,instagram --json >> data/cron.jsonl 2>> data/cron-errors.log
